# {{APP_NAME}}

AppStudio app (self-contained: the framework is vendored).

From the AppStudio framework root:

    spid3r run studio.matrix run {{APP_DIR}}        # native webview
    spid3r run studio.matrix dev {{APP_DIR}}        # hot reload
    spid3r run studio.matrix build {{APP_DIR}} --target web     # browser bundle
    spid3r run studio.matrix build {{APP_DIR}} --target android # Android Studio project
    spid3r run studio.matrix build {{APP_DIR}} --target ios     # xtool package (no Mac needed)
    spid3r run studio.matrix build {{APP_DIR}} --target desktop # single executable
